      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = self.conv_transpose(x)，严格按照 nn.ConvTranspose1d 的公式计算，包括使用传入的 stride、padding、output_padding 和模块 bias。",
        "输出长度 = (input_length - 1) * stride - 2 * padding + kernel_size + output_padding。",
        "先执行转置卷积计算，再对每个输出通道加上 bias（若 bias 不为 None）。",
        "输入、权重、bias 必须是 CUDA float32 张量，输出也是 CUDA float32 张量。",
        "布局需支持任意 stride，实现中可先确保连续或按 stride 处理。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "add_bias_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch_size, out_channels, output_length]",
          "layout": "contiguous or strided",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "bias",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[out_channels, 1]",
          "layout": "contiguous or strided",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[batch_size, out_channels, output_length]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = x + self.bias，执行逐元素加法。",
        "bias 形状 [out_channels, 1] 在 [batch, out_channels, length] 张量上广播，沿 batch 和 length 维度重复。",
        "输出与 x 同形状、同 dtype、同 device。",
        "不改变 stride，但输出可能为新建张量，需满足参考输出 stride。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "round_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch_size, out_channels, output_length]",
          "layout": "contiguous or strided",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[batch_size, out_channels, output_length]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = torch.round(x)，对每个元素执行向最近整数四舍五入，0.5 向远离零方向舍入（即 torch.round 默认行为）。",
        "输出与 x 同形状、同 dtype、同 device。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "triu_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch_size, out_channels, output_length]",
          "layout": "contiguous or strided",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[batch_size, out_channels, output_length]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = torch.triu(x)，保留最后两个维度（out_channels 行，output_length 列）的上三角部分，其余元素置零。",
        "因为 x 为 3D 张量，torch.triu 默认 diagonal=0 作用于最后两维，即逐 batch 对 [out_channels, output_length] 矩阵取上三角。",
        "输出与 x 同形状、同 dtype、同 device。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "reference_steps": [
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_001",
      "source": "x = self.conv_transpose(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "调用 nn.ConvTranspose1d 模块，使用其权重、偏置、stride、padding、output_padding 参数。",
        "输入形状 [512, 3, 2048]，输出形状 [512, 16, 4096]，dtype float32，device cuda。",
        "参考输出 stride 为 [65536, 4096, 1]，即连续张量。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_002",
      "source": "x = x + self.bias",
      "semantics": [
        "逐元素加法，bias 形状 [16, 1] 广播到 [512, 16, 4096]。",
        "输出形状 [512, 16, 4096]，dtype float32，device cuda。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_003",
      "source": "x = torch.round(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "对每个元素四舍五入到最近整数，返回 float32 张量。",
        "输出形状 [512, 16, 4096]，dtype float32，device cuda。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_004",
      "source": "x = torch.triu(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "对 3D 张量的最后两维取上三角，对角线以下元素置零。",
        "输出形状 [512, 16, 4096]，dtype float32，device cuda。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_005",
      "source": "return x",
      "semantics": [
        "返回最终张量，形状 [512, 16, 4096]，dtype float32，device cuda。"
      ]
    }
  ]
